/*		* piecewise linear interpolated:		*/
/*			v = ((t1,v1),(t2,v2),....)		*/
/*	- ALWAYS use "." (dot) when entering numbers!		*/
/*	  For ex. instead of 20, put 20.0			*/
/*	- Use same unit system for all values!			*/
/*	- For each material, all material data must be defined,	*/
/*	  now there are >>14<<

	International System of Units SI:
		temperature: solidus, liquidus, vaporization [K]
		dynamic viscosity [Pa s]
		thermal conductivity [W / m K]
		density [kg / m3]
		specific_heat [J / kg K]
		enthalpy [J / kg]
		thermal expansion coefficient [1 / K]
		electrical resistivity [Om m] = [kg m^2 / s^3 A^2]
		volume of fluid VOF [ ]
		surface tension coefficient dg_dT [N / m K] = [kg / s^2 K ]
		latent_heat_of_fusion [J / kg]
		latent_heat_of_vaporization [J / kg]
		composition [ppm]

	Sources:
		IMZ Gliwice/Poland
		www.specialmetals.com
		www.engineeringtoolbox.com
		Ahmed N., Voisey K.T., McCartney D.G, Investigation in to the effect of beam shape on melt pool
		    characteristics using analytical modelling, Optics and Laser Engineering, 48 (2010) 548-554

------------------------------
History:
	2011    - Przemyslaw Plaszewski (pplaszew@agh.edu.pl)
	2011,2013 - Aleksander Siwek (Aleksander.Siwek@agh.edu.pl)
*/

